  "story": {
    "title": "It is easy to help!",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Hello! I am Molly. I like to help. Helping is fun.",
      "I help my granny to peel green peas.",
      "I help my dad to put things up !",
      "I help my mom to get ready to work.",
      "I help by hanging clothes to dry!",
      "I always keep things in places where it belongs .",
      "I also set plates and spoons when it is time to eat.",
      "I like to help my little brother , when he cannot do things himself . It is fun to help. It is easy to help.",
      "Words List: and help always keep also like belong little brother peas cannot peel clothes plates do ready dry set easy spoons eat things fun time granny when green where hello work"
    ],
